message.content:
{
  "action": "interview_Alma",
  "words": "Alma, I'm coming to the Rialto. Bring your recorder. I'll bring the microphone.",
  "intention": "Record Alma's voice before the theater closes, so her daughter in Pittsburgh can hear it.",
  "detail": "The afternoon is open and the crew is in the lobby. I will leave the TV crew to handle the ballroom party and the stranded driver. My priority is capturing Alma's story while the Rialto is still open and the regional line can carry the reel out. I will go to the Rialto immediately to set up the recording equipment."
}
